<title>USA: U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. Boxed Beef cut-out at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boxed beef generally firm on moderate demand and offerings. Select and Choice rib, round and loin cuts firm, while chuck cuts very uneven.  Beef trimmings generally steady on light demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>---</p>
